        "A Dataset Specialization variable row to the row of its BC in the BC hierarchy table (one row per BC)." ,
        "Reported too: A Dataset Specialization row whose BC has a bc_short_name ending in \"[RETIRED]\", the marker COSMoS publishes for a retired BC, is reported. The link stays." ;
